  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">Many in the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-community\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Community</strong></a> have asked how the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-main-radix-legal-entities\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Foundation</strong></a><strong id=\"\"> </strong>and its subsidiary, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-main-radix-legal-entities\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Tokens (Jersey) Ltd</strong> </a>(RTJL), participates in staking and <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-node-2\"><strong id=\"\">validator node</strong></a>-running on the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-radix-public-network-and-radix-ledger\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Public Network</strong></a>.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">As a fully <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/is-radix-decentralized\"><strong id=\"\">decentralized</strong></a> and <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/is-radix-permissioned-or-permissionless\"><strong id=\"\">permissionless</strong></a> network, no <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/entities-in-the-radix-ecosystem\"><strong id=\"\">entity </strong></a>or team member has any special rights, but they may still participate in exactly the same way as anyone else. So in keeping with the Radix Foundation’s mission, the Foundation and its subsidiaries will seek to apply their <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-token\"><strong id=\"\">tokens</strong></a> and resources to the maximum benefit of the network and the community, which may involve staking their <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-xrd-and-exrd-tokens\"><strong id=\"\">XRD</strong></a> tokens. More details about how Radix may stake its own XRD tokens can be found <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-the-radix-foundation-stake-its-own-xrd-holdings-to-which-validators\"><strong id=\"\">here</strong></a>.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Further reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-the-radix-foundation-operate-validator-nodes\"><strong id=\"\">Does the Radix Foundation operate validator nodes?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-the-radix-foundation-stake-its-own-xrd-holdings-to-which-validators\"><strong id=\"\">Does the Radix Foundation stake its own XRD holdings? To which validators?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-radix-receive-incentive-rewards-from-staking-and-validator-node-running-2\"><strong id=\"\">Does the Radix Foundation receive incentive rewards from staking and validator node-running?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-radix-operated-validator-nodes-accept-delegated-stake-from-the-community-2\"><strong id=\"\">Do validator nodes operated by the Radix Foundation accept delegated stake from the community?</strong></a><br></li></ul>",
